<title>BELGIUM: EU sets monthly syrup, non-annex II export refunds.</title>
<headline>EU sets monthly syrup, non-annex II export refunds.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee set the March monthly export refund rates for syrups on Wednesday, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The rate for syrups was set at 41.47 Ecus per 100 kg and for inulin syrup at 78.79 ecus per 100 kg.</p>
<p>The Eu also set non-annex II sugar export refunds for March, the official said. The rate for white sugar was set at 41.47 Ecus per 100 kg and for raw at 38.15 Ecus per 100 kg.</p>
<p>--Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
